message: "If you use stagegate-agents, please cite it as below."
title: "stagegate-agents: a staged, human-gated delivery pipeline for Claude Code"
abstract: >-
  Nineteen Claude Code agents that take a feature from idea to merged pull request behind three
  human approval gates, with guard hooks, an OS sandbox and CI gates that enforce the rules in
  code. Extracted from a production platform on AWS EKS.
